| Periode | Tid | Pris/kWh |
|---------|-----|----------|
| Off-peak | 00:00-06:00 | 1.50 DKK |
| Normal | 06:00-17:00, 21:00-00:00 | 2.50 DKK |
| Peak | 17:00-21:00 | 4.00 DKK |

